00:11:01.099 --> 00:11:03.740
This many people want to see a real sport.

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:05.156
Huge difference.

00:11:05.156 --> 00:11:08.329
So the market of people
that are like, vale tudo,

00:11:08.329 --> 00:11:10.345
and we want the whole all the
no rules and all that stuff,

00:11:10.345 --> 00:11:12.127
