00:11:12.127 --> 00:11:15.337
no holds, no rules and
(bleep) wasn't very exciting.

00:11:15.337 --> 00:11:17.766
You know what I mean, it really wasn't.

00:11:17.766 --> 00:11:20.458
And what we try to do, is we
keep trying to push the sport

00:11:20.458 --> 00:11:22.267
to be more and more things.

00:11:22.267 --> 00:11:23.642
You have to understand what my job is,

00:11:23.642 --> 00:11:26.566
what my job is in this day and age,

00:11:26.566 --> 00:11:27.673
How old are you?

00:11:27.673 --> 00:11:28.518
- 27.

00:11:28.518 --> 00:11:31.031
