be home to answer the phone.

00:11:42.232 --> 00:11:43.878
'Cause we didn't have answering machines,

00:11:43.878 --> 00:11:45.851
any of that stuff, right?

00:11:45.851 --> 00:11:49.340
So, this day and age,
if you want to see some

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:52.510
crazy (bleep), go on YouTube,

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:54.631
type in any crazy (bleep) you want,

00:11:54.631 --> 00:11:55.464
(audience laughs)

00:11:55.464 --> 00:11:57.584
