00:12:00.579 --> 00:12:01.412
Right?

00:12:02.619 --> 00:12:04.241
You can go to the movies, you can go here,

00:12:04.241 --> 00:12:05.679
you can do this, that, you can do,

00:12:05.679 --> 00:12:07.859
there's a tons of things you can do.

00:12:07.859 --> 00:12:11.457
I have to convince you
to stay home on Saturday,

00:12:11.457 --> 00:12:12.671
not only stay home on Saturday,

00:12:12.671 --> 00:12:14.606
when you've been busting
your ass at school all week,

00:12:14.606 --> 00:12:16.945
working, all the other
things you've got to do,

00:12:16.945 --> 00:12:18.036
