dinner, or go to a movie.

00:12:22.947 --> 00:12:25.153
I compete with all these things.

00:12:25.153 --> 00:12:27.563
Basketball's on, football's
on, you know what I mean?

00:12:27.563 --> 00:12:29.428
All this other stuff that goes on,

00:12:29.428 --> 00:12:31.792
I have to convince you
to stay home on Saturday,

00:12:31.792 --> 00:12:35.490
and pay $55 dollars to watch my event.

00:12:35.490 --> 00:12:36.562
That's what I have to do.

00:12:36.562 --> 00:12:39.712
That's my job in this business.

00:12:39.712 --> 00:12:44.155
