00:12:57.049 --> 00:12:58.795
It's not going to be easy.

00:12:58.795 --> 00:13:01.038
But that is what I do for a living.

00:13:01.038 --> 00:13:04.159
I put together fights
that are compelling enough

00:13:04.159 --> 00:13:05.699
to make you stay home on a Saturday night

00:13:05.699 --> 00:13:07.490
and pay $55 dollars for it.

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:09.907
Anything that you do in life,

00:13:10.775 --> 00:13:12.853
